 correction) \"sigFigs\" -- accuracy of timestamps \"snapLen\" -- maximum packet size \"network\" -- data link type \"count\" -- total number of packets read in this file. Your program will have to calculate this and for each packet   a packet number, starting at 0 (See posted format) \"tmSec\" -- timestamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":219850,"global_rank":212548},{"name":"1z-z1/qtMediaPlayer","owner":"1z-z1","html_url":"https://github.com/1z-z1/qtMediaPlayer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"A basic media player in qt.","topics":[],"score":219850,"global_rank":212576},{"name":"maskedband1t/bst","owner":"maskedband1t","html_url":"https://github.com/maskedband1t/bst","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219850,"global_rank":212589},{"name":"estherwang01/aoc23","owner":"estherwang01","html_url":"https://github.com/estherwang01/aoc23","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219843,"global_rank":212617},{"name":"abdullahmorrison/advent-of-code","owner":"abdullahmorrison","html_url":"https://github.com/abdullahmorrison/advent-of-code","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":["advent-of-code"],"score":219843,"global_rank":212643},{"name":"chardan/2018-SES-Workshop","owner":"chardan","html_url":"https://github.com/chardan/2018-SES-Workshop","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Examples and notes from C++17 breakout session.","topics":[],"score":219826,"global_rank":212770},{"name":"stevenvergenz/des-util","owner":